+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` on the rental service returns `{ bookingId, refund }` and frees the booking's
+equipment; a booking can be cancelled once (unknown or already cancelled ids throw). Refund per dl-004:
+full total 48h or more before the start, half (rounded to the cent) before the start, 0 from the start.
+In `src/index.ts`: `cancel`, `refundFor`. Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts` (red-first, new
+behaviour): the three refund tiers, rounding, freed equipment, double cancel, unknown id, invalid time;
+all pass.
